{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112646","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112646/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112646/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112646/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112646","id":3612934872,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7XWQLY","number":112646,"title":"[UX] Export presets names aren't validated","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-11-11T16:04:56Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T01:37:49Z","closed_at":"2025-11-18T01:37:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: Godot 4.0.4 and later\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (a4607b4a6) - macOS Tahoe (26.2.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M3 Max (Apple9) - Apple M3 Max (16 threads) - 48.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen adding a new export preset, if the default name already exists, it will add a counter to the name equivalent to the number of attempts it took.\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Take note that these screenshots include \"Async PCKs\" content that is currently from a local branch of mine.\n\n<img width=\"745\" height=\"515\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d755ed1-321c-4712-9284-aa13362985ef\" />\n\nBut it is really easy to rename one of these \"Web <N>\" to \"Web\" without any issue nor error.\n\n<img width=\"740\" height=\"512\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f1adb62-208e-4c58-afe7-e89d8ed53d88\" />\n\nAfterwards, when using a command like `godot --headless --export-debug \"Web\"`, it seems to take the first export preset in the list named \"Web\", so it may leave an export preset unexportable from the command line.\n\n<figure>\n\n<img width=\"743\" height=\"516\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2bcb95e2-1398-471f-bc3f-5d31cc0c3937\" />\n\n<figcaption markdown=1>\n\nIt's even possible to set the name as an empty string.\n\n</figcaption>\n\n</figure>\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the export window.\n2. Click on \"Add\"\n3. Select the Web platform.\n4. Repeat steps 2. and 3. at least once.\n5. Select \"Web <N>\"\n6. Change the current preset name to \"Web\"\n7. Realize that the editor is OK with having two export presets that have the same name\n8. Change the current preset name to \"\"\n9. Realize that the editor is OK with having a blank export preset name\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112646/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112646/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}